# Railway Deployment Configuration
# Documentation: https://docs.railway.app/

# Build Command (nếu cần custom)
# nixpacks build -n parking-api -p PORT .

# Start Command
# java -jar build/libs/parkingmanagement-*.jar

# Environment Variables được set trên Railway Dashboard:
# SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL=jdbc:mysql://<host>:<port>/railway
# SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME=<username>
# SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD=<password>

# Các biến khác:
# PORT=<port từ Railway>
# CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=<cloud_name>
# CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=<api_key>
# CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=<api_secret>
# JWT_SECRET=<your-jwt-secret>
